   "en": "DATA",
   "title": "你需要准备什么",
   "html": "<p>数据获取的门槛是<strong>拍摄规范</strong>而不是设备：一台消费级无人机加一块打印的标定板就能起步。真正要投入人力的是裂缝掩膜标注——裂缝细长、对比度低，一条一条描，1000 条掩膜是两三个人一周的工作量；好在产状实测记录天然就是验证集。</p><div class='checklist'><div class='cl-head'><span>数据准备清单 · 3 项</span><span class='cl-prog'><span id='cl-txt'>0 / 3</span><span class='cl-bar'><i id='cl-fill'></i></span></span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='0'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>露头多角度照片</span><span class='cl-s'>单露头 200—500 张，含标定板</span></span><span class='cl-n'>裂缝掩膜 ≥ 1000 条</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='1'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>无人机倾斜摄影点云</span><span class='cl-s'>覆盖整个露面，厘米级分辨率</span></span><span class='cl-n'>无需标注</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='2'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>产状实测记录</span><span class='cl-s'>罗盘实测 100—200 条</span></span><span class='cl-n'>作为验证集</span></div></div>"
